      "updated_at": "2026-07-22T19:53:48Z",
      "body": "Superseded by e3ddd7d (already in main), which completed the full fixed-width conversion with u64 across all serde-serialized router structs and state maps, with exact-JSON regression tests and proof that the pre-change manifold cache still imports. The one unique improvement here — get_expert_counts going fixed-width u32 instead of keeping the usize ABI — was adopted and pushed as 9d91473 (u32 keeps the JS dashboard on Uint32Array; u64 would have flipped it to BigInt). Everything else in this PR duplicates the merged work, so closing; thanks for the nudge on the export type.",
